#! ia 1.0

@authoring-guide product-system-product
  meaning
    says "Author a stable product and its typed plan associations without confusing domain ownership with access rights."
    answers "When should an author select product and how is its consumer contract checked?"
  reference
    owner product-system
    word product
    schema @schema product
    document ".ia/src/systems/product-system/schemas/product.SPEC.md"
    default-file "product.ia"
  guidance
    select-when "A stable product identity groups work plans across service resource bindings."
    avoid-when "Only composition, a release archive, an obligation or a single work plan is needed."
    consider "Use a local agent and real plan references; exact source revision and directory authority are separate service inputs."
  relationships
    cites @schema product
